tes. You have been warned.'=>'Sabuntawa zuwa sigar Beta zata maye gurbin wacce ka saka ta %s da sabon sigar Beta - yi amfani da shi da hankali, kuma kada a yi amfani da shi a kan rukunin yanar gizo na aiki. An riga an gargade ka.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'An caji %s','Billing'=>'Biya','Billing & Invoices'=>'Lissafin Kuɗi da Daftari','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'An hana','Blocking'=>'Ana rufewa','Blog ID'=>'Lambar Shafi na Yanar Gizo','Body'=>'Jiki','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ee - adiresosan biyu nawa ne','Bundle'=>'Kunjiya','Bundle Plan'=>'Tsarin Kunshin','Business name'=>'Sunan kasuwanci','Buy license'=>'Sayari da lasisi','Buy a license now'=>'Sayi lasisi yanzu','Cancel'=>'Soke','Cancel Installation'=>'Soke Shigarwa','Cancel Subscription'=>'Soke Biyan Kuɗi','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Idan ba kwa shirin amfani da wannan %1$s a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon (ko wani rukunin yanar gizon ba) - kuna son soke %2$s ma?','Cancel Trial'=>'Soke Gwaji','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Soke gwaji zai hana shiga zuwa duk wasu abubuwa na musamman nan take. Kuna da tabbas?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Soke %s & Ci gaba','Cancelled'=>'An soke','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Ana soke biyan kuɗi','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ba za a iya samun mabudin lasisin ka ba?','Change License'=>'Canjin Lasisi','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'An aikohaka na tabbatarwa zuwa ga %s. Dole ne ka tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa. Idan ba za ka iya samun imel din ba, don Allah ka dubi babban fayil din spam naka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'An tura imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s. Mai imel din dole ne ya tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s shine sabon mai mallakar asusun.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Mun gode da tabbatar da canjin mallaka. An aika da imel zuwa %s don amincewa ta ƙarshe.','Change Ownership'=>'Canja Mallaka','Change Plan'=>'Canji Tsari','Change User'=>'Canja Mai Amfani','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Ta hanyar sauya mai amfani, kun yarda ku tura mallakar asusun zuwa ga:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Canjin tarihin kaya','Changing user, please wait'=>'Ana canza mai amfani, don Allah a jira','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Idan ba ka karɓi imel ɗin ba, gwada duba babban fayil ɗin da ba a buƙata ba ko bincika imel daga %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Biya kuɗi','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Zabi shafuka har zuwa %s domin kunna lasisin a kai.','City'=>'Gari','Clear API Cache'=>'Share Cache din API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Share Tsabtace Abubuwan Sabuntawa','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Danna nan','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Danna nan don amfani da plugin din ba tare da nuna suna ba','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Danna don ganin sharhi da suka bayar da ƙimar %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s shine adireshin imel na abokin ciniki na','Code'=>'Lambar sirri','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Kashi %s lokacin da wani abokin ciniki ya sayi sabon lasisi.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kamar yadda muke keɓe kwanaki 30 don yiwuwar mayar da kuɗi, muna biyan kwamitocin da suka wuce kwanaki 30 ne kawai.','Communication'=>'Sadarwa','Compatible up to'=>'Mai jituwa har zuwa','complete the opt-in'=>'cika rajista','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Taya murna','Never miss an important update'=>'Kada ka taba rasa muhimman sabuntawa','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Na gode da sabuntawa zuwa %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Yi rijista don karɓar sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro da abubuwa, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu mahimman bayanan muhalli na WordPress. Wannan zai taimaka mana mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da rukunin yanar gizon ku kuma ya fi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙatar ya yi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Zabi ka karɓi sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro & fasali, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu basic WordPress environment info.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Idan ka tsallake wannan, babu damuwa! %1$s zai ci gaba da aiki sosai.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Mun gabatar da wannan zaɓi don kar ka taɓa rasa wani muhimmin sabuntawa kuma ka taimake mu mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da shafin yanar gizon ku kuma ya fi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙatar ya yi.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Muna farin cikin gabatar da hadewar Freemius a matakin cibiyar sadarwa.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'A lokacin aiwatar da sabuntawa mun gano %s shafi/shafuka a cikin hanyar sadarwa wanda/wadanda har yanzu ke buƙatar kulawar ku.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Lokacin sabuntawa mun gano shafin/shafuka %d da ke jiran a kunna lasisi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Idan kana so ka yi amفani da %s a waɗannan shafuka, don Allah ka shigar da maɓallin lasisinka a ƙasa sannan ka danna maɓallin kunna.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'A madadin haka, za ka iya tsallake shi a yanzu ka kunna lasisin daga baya, a shafin Asusun da ke matakin cibiyar sadarwa na %s ɗinka.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Haɗe','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Da zarar ka gama, kashe %s sannan ka sake kunnawa.','Contact'=>'Tuntuɓi','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Don Allah sanar da mu idan kana son mu tuntube ka domin sabunta tsaro & siffofi, abubuwan ilmantarwa, da kuma tayi-tayi daga lokaci zuwa lokaci:','Contact Support'=>'Tuntuɓi Tallafi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Mun ba da hakuri bisa rashin jin daɗin da aka samu kuma muna nan don taimaka muku idan kun ba mu dama.','Contact Us'=>'Tuntuɓe Mu','Please contact us here'=>'Don Allah tuntuɓe mu a nan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Da fatan za a tuntuɓe mu tare da wannan saƙon:','Continue'=>'Ci gaba','Contributors'=>'Masu igo','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Ba a iya kunna %s ba.','Country'=>'Ƙasa','Cron Type'=>'Nau\'in Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Muna amfani da dakin karatu na PHP cURL don kiran API, wanda shahararren dakin karatu ne kuma yawanci ana shigar da shi kuma an kunna shi ta atomatik. Abin baƙin ciki shine, ba a kunna cURL ba (ko an kashe shi) a uwar garken ku.','data'=>'bayanai','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'An kunna yanayin matsala da nasara kuma za a kashe shi ta atomatik cikin mintuna 60. Haka kuma zaka iya kashe shi da wuri ta hanyar danna hanyar haɗi ta "Dakatar da Matsala".','Date'=>'Ranka','Deactivate'=>'Kashewa','Deactivate the free version'=>'Kashe sigar kyauta','Deactivate License'=>'Kashe Lasisi','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Kashe lasisin ku zai hana duk wani fasali na musamman, amma zai ba da damar kunna lasisin a wani shafin. Shin kana da tabbacin kana son ci gaba?','Deactivation'=>'Kashewa','Yes - %s'=>'Ee - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Sallama & %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Kashewa ko cire %s zai kashe lasisin ta atomatik, wanda za ku iya amfani da shi a wani shafin yanar gizon.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Idan kana da lokaci, don Allah sanar da mu dalilin da ya sa kake %s','Debug Log'=>'Rubutun Kuskure','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Gyara kura-kurai','delegate'=>'sanya wakil','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Idan ka danna shi, za a mika wannan hukuncin ga masu gudanar da shafukan.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Ba da ikon gudanarwa ga Admins na Shafin','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'Ba wa Manajojin Shafin Ikon & Ci gaba','Delegating, please wait'=>'Ana bayar da izini, don Allah a jira','verbDelete'=>'Goge','Delete All Accounts'=>'Goge Duk Asusun Asusu','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Shin kana da tabbas kana son share duk bayanan Freemius?','Plugin installer section titleDescription'=>'Bayani','Details'=>'Cikakkun Bayanai'