dentials.'=>'Ba a iya haɗawa da tsarin fayil ba. Da fatan za a tabbatar da bayanan shiga ku.','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'An samu kuskuren API da ba a yi tsammani ba yayin sarrafa buƙatar ku. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan ‘yan mintoci kaɗan kuma idan har yanzu bai yi aiki ba, tuntuɓi marubucin %s tare da waɗannan:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Kuskuren da ba a tsammani ba, a sake gwadawa bayan mintuna 5. Idan kuskuren ya ci gaba, da fatan za a tuntuɓi sashen tallafi.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Cire %s zai kashe lasisin ta atomatik, wanda za ka iya amfani da shi a wani shafin yanar gizon.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'An faru wani sabon kuskure da ba a sani ba.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Karatun kwamishoni mara iyaka.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Sabuntawa mara iyaka','verbUpdate'=>'Sabunta','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Kuna son ci gaba da sabuntawar?','Update'=>'Sabunta','Update License'=>'Sabunta Lasisi','Upgrade'=>'Haɓaka','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Sanarwa Mai Muhimmanci ta Ingantawa:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Loda kuma a kunna sigar da aka sauke','User Dashboard'=>'Rukunin Mai Amfani','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba za mu iya kammala sabunta imel ɗin ba. Wani mai amfani da irin wannan imel ɗin yana da rijista tuni.','If you would like to give up the ownership of the %1$s\'s account to %2$s click the Change Ownership button.'=>'Idan kana son mika ikon mallakar asusun %1$s ga %2$s, danna maballin Canza Mallaka.','User ID'=>'ID na Mai Amfani','User key'=>'Maɓallin mai amfani','Users'=>'Masu amfani','Value'=>'Ƙima','Verification mail was 