wa.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Lamba ta gari / Lambar akwatin gidan taba',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s don samun damar shiga sabuntawar tsaro da fasali na sigar %2$s, da tallafi.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'%1$s sabuntawar tsaro & fasali ta atomatik da kuma ayyukan da ake biyan kuɗi za su ci gaba da aiki ba tare da katsewa ba har zuwa %2$s (ko lokacin da lasisin ku ya ƙare, duk wanda ya fara zuwa).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s don samun damar shiga sabuntawar tsaro da fasali na sigar %2$s, da kuma goyon baya.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'An haifar da wani kuskure da ba a sani ba yayin kokarin saita yanayin beta na mai amfani.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'An bayyana wani kuskure da ba a sani ba yayin ƙoƙarin sauya yan-gizo (white-label) na lasisin.','Annual'=>'Na shekara-shekara','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Ta danna "Opt Out", %s ba zai ƙara iya ganin sunanka da imel ɗinka ba.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Ta hanyar danna "Opt Out", ba za a sake aika da bayanan bincike zuwa ga %s ba.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Ta hanyar cire haɗin gidan yanar gizon, an goge bayanan bincike da aka raba a baya game da %1$s kuma ba za su ƙara zama a bayyane ga %2$s ba.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Ta hanyar zaɓin fitowa daga raba wannan bayanin tare da uwar garken ɗaukakawa, dole ne ka bincika sabbin saki na %1$s kuma ka zazzage & shigar da su da hannu. Ba kawai matsala ba ce, amma rasa ɗaukakawa na iya sanya shafinka cikin haɗari kuma ya haifar da matsalolin dacewa marasa amfani, don haka muna matukar ba da shawarar kiyaye waɗannan mahimman izini.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Soke %1$s - Ban buƙatar ƙarin sabuntawar tsaro & fasali, ko goyon baya ga %2$s domin ba na shirin amfani da %3$s a kan wannan, ko wani rarshen intanet ba.','Cancel %s?'=>'Soke %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Ana soke %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Ana soke %s...','Click here'=>'Danna nan','Deactivating'=>'Ana kashewa','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Cire haɗin gidan yanar gizon zai cire %s na har abada daga asusun Dashboard na Mai Amfani.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Domin isar da sabuntawar tsaro da fasali ta atomatik, da kuma gudanar da lasisi da kariya, %s na buƙatar:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Don iskar da sabunta tsaro da abubuwa, da kuma sarrafa lasisi, %s yana buƙatar','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius injiniya ce ta lasisi da sabunta software','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Idan wannan kwafi ne na dogon lokaci, don kiyaye sabuntawa ta atomatik da fasali na biya bayan %1$s, da fatan za a %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Shin %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Shiga Shirin Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Shiga shirin Beta','License'=>'Lasisi','License Key'=>'Mukullin Lasisi','License key'=>'Maɓullin lasisi','Monthly'=>'Kowane wata','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Sunaye, alamomi, juzu\'i, da ko a kunna ko a\'a','New Version Available'=>'Sabon Sigar Akwai','Optional'=>'Na Zabi','Plan'=>'Tsari','Products'=>'Kayayyaki','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Raba bayanai masu nuna matsala yana taimakawa wajen samar da ƙarin aiki wanda ya dace da gidan yanar gizon ku, guje wa rashin jituwar sigar WordPress ko PHP wanda zai iya lalata gidan yanar gizon, da gane waɗanne harsuna & yankuna ya kamata a fassara %s zuwa gare su kuma a daidaita su.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Don haka za ka iya sake amfani da lasisin lokacin da %s bai kuma zama mai aiki ba.','Subscription'=>'Biyan kuɗi','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'The %1$s za ta riƙa aika mahimman bayanai na lasisi lokaci-lokaci zuwa %2$s don bincika sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, da kuma tabbatar da ingancin lasisin ku.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Akwai %1$s na %2$s da ake da shi.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Don tabbatar da jituwa da kuma guje wa rikici tare da shigar da plugins da jigogi naka.','Trial'=>'Gwaji','View %s State'=>'Duba Matsayin %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Duba Babban Bayanin %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ee, %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s don dalilin gwaji, staging, ko haɓakawa.','You have a %s license.'=>'Kuna da lasisi %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Kun sayi lasisin %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please m