ed.'=>'An adana saitunan.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Duba shirin Pro da farashinsa','Front-end output'=>'Fitowar gaban shafin','Class name prefix'=>'Ratabayon sunan Class','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane sunan aji da filogin ke bugawa akan shafukanku yana farawa da wannan gaba, ta yadda shafukan ba za su bayyana wane filogin ne ya gina su ba. Haruffa kanana ko lambobi 1 zuwa 8, wadanda suka fara da harafi.','Save'=>'Ajiye','Beta updates'=>'Sabuntawar Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar nau\'ikan beta azaman sabuntawa.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar ingantattun sassa kawai.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Canza wannan a shafin Asusu','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Ana bayar da nau\'ikan Beta ga shigarwar Pro da ke da lasisi waɗanda ke haɗa da asusun su. Da zarar an haɗa, zaku iya shiga daga shafin Asusun.','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'An dakatar da juya wannan post din kafin a gama, don haka an tsallake post din. Buɗe shi don juya shi, ko kuma ka sake juya shi daga nan.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Babu wani ajiyar baya na wannan wallafe-wallafen da za a dawo da shi.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana abin da aka canza ba.','Unknown error.'=>'Kuskure wanda ba a sani ba.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Ba a bincika wani tsohon abun ciki ba tukuna.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Maido da tsohon abun ciki: %1$d na %2$d posts.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Canza tsohuwar abun ciki: %1$d na posts %2$d.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'An gama sauyawa: %1$d an dawo da su, %2$d sun gaza.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Canjin ya kammala: %1$d an canza, %2$d ba su canza ba, %3$d sun gaza.','Legacy content'=>'Tsohon abun ciki','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'An canza shafukan da aka yi da tsofaffin sifofin Page Builder Sandwich zuwa blocks a bango. Ana yin madadin kowanne post a gaba, don haka ana iya mayar da kowanecanji zuwa yadda yake.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Har yanzu post %d yana dauke da tsohon abun ciki.' . "\0" . 'Mawallafan %d har yanzu suna ɗauke da tsohon abun ciki.','%d post has a backup.'=>'Post %d yana da ajiyar baya.' . "\0" . '%d posts suna da madadin ajiyar bayanai.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Ba a iya sarrafa rubutu %d ba' . "\0" . 'Ba a iya sarrafa wallafe-wallafen %d ba','Post %d'=>'Rubutu na %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'An fara sauyawa. Yana ci gaba a bango; za ku iya barin wannan shafin.','Convert legacy content'=>'Maida tsohon abun ciki sabon salo','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Sake dawo da kowane gidan yanar gizon da aka maida zuwa tsohuwar sigarsa? Canje-canjen da aka yi wa waɗannan gidajen yanar gizon tun lokacin da aka maida su za su ɓace.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'An fara sauyawa. Yana ci gaba a bango; zaku iya barin wannan shafin.','Undo all conversions'=>'Soke duk juyawar','Shortcode tag'=>'Lambar gajeren lokaci','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Yi amfani da haruffa, lamba, da alamomin gajeren layi da na karkashin layi kawai.','Attribute name'=>'Sunan sifa','Add attribute'=>'Ƙara siffa','Content'=>'Abun ciki','Shortcode'=>'Gajeriyar lamba','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Zaɓi alamar gajeren lamba (shortcode) a cikin saitunan bazuwar.','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Ba a samun ikon "%s" daga tsohon edita a cikin editan tubali ba. Shigar da ƙimar a matsayin rubutu.','Choose image'=>'Zaɓi hoton','Choose file'=>'Zaɓi fayil','— Default —'=>'— Na asali —','Advanced styling'=>'Tsara salo na gaba','Inline CSS'=>'Inline CSS','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Sanarwar CSS, alal misali: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Tasiri (tsofaffin aji)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Sunayen tasiri masu rarrabuwa da sarari da aka kawo daga tsofaffin sigogi, alal misali: hover-shadow','Row'=>'Jergi','Width'=>'Fadi','Content width'=>'Fadin abubuwa','Full width'=>'Cikakken faɗi','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Cikakken faɗi, an ajiye abubuwa a tsakiya','Link'=>'Haɗi','Link address'=>'Adireshin mahada','Open in a new tab'=>'Buɗe a cikin sabon shafin yanar gizo','Link relationship'=>'Alakar mahada','Alignment'=>'Daidaita shafi','None'=>'Babu kowa','Left'=>'Hagu','Centre'=>'Tsakiya','Right'=>'Dama','Button text'=>'Rubutun maɓalli','Add text…'=>'Ƙara rubutu…','Icon'=>'Alama','SVG markup'=>'Alamar SVG','Scripts, links and external references are removed before the icon is shown.'=>'Ana cire rubututtuka, hanyoyin sadarwa, da kuma nassoshi na waje kafin a nuna hoton alamar.','Accessible label'=>'Alamar samuwa','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Bar a banza domin gunkin ado.','Paste SVG markup in the block settings.'=>'Manna da alamar SVG a cikin saitunan shafi.','New setting name'=>'Sabon sunan saitin','For example: title or text'=>'Misali: taken ko rubutu','Add setting'=>'Ƙara saitin','Widget'=>'Widget','Choose a widget'=>'Zaɓi widget','