','Buttons'=>'Maɓallai','Dropdown'=>'Jerin zaɓi','Language codes'=>'Lambarorin harshe','Show each language as'=>'Nuna kowane harshe a matsayin','Language name'=>'Sunan harshe','Language code'=>'Lambar harshe','Name and code'=>'Suna da lamba','Flags'=>'Alamomi','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'A kashe yake tun asali: tuta kasa ce, ba harshe ba.','Include the current language'=>'Haɗa da harshen yanzu','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Boye da harsunan da ba a fassara wannan shafin zuwa gare su ba','Stack vertically'=>'Aza a tsaye','Colours'=>'Launi','Background'=>'Asali','Current language text'=>'Harshen da ake ciki a yanzu','Current language background'=>'Asalin harshen baya','Border'=>'Iyakoki','Size and spacing'=>'Girma da sarari','Corner radius'=>'Radius ɗin kusurwa','Space between languages'=>'Sarari tsakanin harsuna','Text size'=>'Girman rubutu','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s yana gyara wannan shafin kuma. Ajiye zai iya rubuta a kan gyare-gyarensa.','Block library'=>'Laburaren buloka','Layers'=>'Taruka','Close panel'=>'Rufe kwamitin','Page canvas'=>'Filin shafi','Revisions'=>'Gyare-gyare','Block settings'=>'Saitunan katange','Add block: %s'=>'Ƙara tubali: %s','(no title)'=>'(babu lakabi)','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Buɗe a Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Sake dawo da shi','Redo'=>'Sake yi','Show or hide layers'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye yadudduka','Show or hide the block library'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye ɗakin karatu na bulolin','Show revisions'=>'Nuna gyare-gyare','Open the normal editor'=>'Buɗe edita na al\'ada','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Gajerun hanyoyin madannai','Preview: desktop'=>'Dubawa: kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka','Preview: tablet'=>'Dubawa: kwamfutar hannu','Preview: mobile'=>'Gani a wayar hannu:','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Kwafi salin zababben tubalin','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Liya sanyin salon a kan zababben tubalin','Copy the selected section'=>'Kwafi sashin da aka zaɓa','Paste a copied section'=>'Liƙa sashen da aka kwafi','Turn off safe mode'=>'Kashe yanayin aminci','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Kunna yanayin aminci (sauran ɗorawa a kashe, a gare ka, a Studio kaɗai)','Published'=>'An buga','Scheduled'=>'An tsara','Pending review'=>'Ana jiran dubawa','Private'=>'Maigirma','Draft'=>'Da-aka-tsara','All changes saved'=>'An adana duk sauye-sauye','Saving…'=>'Ana adanawa...','Autosaving…'=>'Ana adanawa ta atomatik…','Unsaved changes'=>'Canjin da ba a ajiyewa ba','autosaved'=>'an adana ta atomatik','Desktop preview'=>'Samfurin kwamfuta ta tebur','Tablet preview'=>'Dubawar kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka','Mobile preview'=>'Duban wayar hannu','Studio toolbar'=>'Sandar kayan aiki ta Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Koma zuwa edita na al\'ada','Page title'=>'Sunan shafi','Preview width'=>'Fadin samfoti','Command palette'=>'Kundin umarni','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Duba shafi (yana buɗe a cikin sabon shafi)','Save draft'=>'Ajiye daftari','Publish'=>'Bugawa','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Sake dawo da canjin da ba a ajiyee ba?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Wannan shafin yana da canje-canjen da ba a taba adana su ba. An kiyaye su a cikin wannan burauz din:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Wannan shafin yana da sabon kwafin da aka adana ta atomatik fiye da sigar da aka adana:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Mayar da canje-canjen da ba a ajiyewa ba','Discard'=>'Kora da shi','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda gyare-gyaren ba.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'An dawo da fasalin da aka gyara. Ajiye don riƙe shi, ko a soke don komawa baya.','Close revisions'=>'Rufe bita','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Ba a yi gyare-gyare ba tukuna. Kowace adanawa tana ƙirƙirar ɗaya.','Revision from %s'=>'Revision daga %s','Restore this revision'=>'Maido da wannan bita','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Ba aweza canza yanayin aminci ba.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Yanayin tsaro yana kunne.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'An kashe wani plug-in %d daban, domin ku kadai kuma a cikin Sandwich Studio kadai. Wannan ba zai shafi raddadin rukunin yanar gizo na gaske da sauran masu amfani ba.' . "\0" . 'Wasu plugins %d an kashe su, domin ku da kuma a Sandwich Studio kadai. Ba a shafar shafin da ke aiki da sauran masu amfani ba.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Yanayin lafiya: kashe sauranfulojoji a cikin Studio, don ku kadai','Safe mode'=>'Yanayin tsaro','Save your changes.'=>'Ajiye canje-canjenku.','Undo your last change.'=>'Sake dawo da sauye-kayenku na ƙarshe.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Maimaita abin da ka soke na karshe.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye kwamitin yadudduka.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Nuna waɗannan gajerun hanyoyin madannai.','Select a block first.'=>'Zaɓi buloka tukuna.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'An kwafi salon. Manna shi a kan kowane buloku, a kan wannan shafin ko wani.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Mai binciken ya ki kwafi.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'An kwafi sashen. Manna shi a kowane shafi, a wannan shafin ko wani.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ba a adana salon da aka kwafi daga Sandwich Studio a cikin allo ba.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Salon da aka manna a kan tubali %d.' . "\0" . 'An shafa salo a kan tubalan %d.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Wannan salon bai dace da katangar da aka zaɓa ba.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Allon kwafi ba shi da wani yanki da aka kwafa.','Section pasted.'=>'An manna da aka liƙa.','Paste style'=>'Manna salon salo','Paste section'=>'Manna sashe','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Latsa Ctrl+V (ko Cmd+V a kan Mac) anan don mannawa','Copy style'=>'Kofe salo','Copy section'=>'Kwafi sashin','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara a cikin Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'An adana ba ta yi nasara ba. Duba hanyar sadarwarku kuma ku sake gwadawa; an kiyaye sauye-sauyenkanku a cikin wannan burauz din.','Published.'=>'An buga','Saved.'=>'An adana.','block titleButton link'=>'Mahadar maɓalli','block descriptionA link styled as a button.'=>'Hanyar haɗi mai salo kamar maɓalli.','block keywordbutton'=>'mabuɗi','block keywordlink'=>'mahada','block keywordcall to action'=>'kira zuwa ga aiki','block titleColumn'=>'Shafi\'i','block descriptionA column inside a row. It can hold any block.'=>'Wani shafi a cikin jere. Yana iya ɗaukar kowane buloka.','block keywordcolumn'=>'shafi','block keywordlayout'=>'tsari','block titleLanguage switcher (sample)'=>'Mai sauya harshe (misali)','block descriptionLists the site\'s languages from the translation plugin, when one is active. It renders nothing otherwise.'=>'Ana lissafa harsunan shafin daga matosai na fassara, idan akwai mai aiki. Ba ya nuna komai in ba haka ba.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Harshe','block keywordswitcher'=>'mai sauyawa','block titleSample content'=>'Samfurin abun ciki','block descriptionA heading and a paragraph, rendered with neutral class names. It is the reference block for the translation contract.'=>'Wani take da sakin layi, waɗanda aka nuna da sunayen aji marasa ɓata guda. Shi ne tubalin misali don kwangilar fassara.','block keywordsample'=>'misali','block keywordtext'=>'rubutu','block titleIcon'=>'Alama','block descriptionAn SVG icon. The markup is cleaned before it is shown.'=>'Alamar SVG. An tsabtace lambar kafin a nuna ta.','block keywordicon'=>'gunkadi','block keywordsvg'=>'svg','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Mai sauya harshe','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another language, styled to match y